    "meaning": "Can use 'can' with an increasing range of adverbs (including 'easily', 'hardly', 'now', 'probably', 'sometimes', 'still') in the normal mid position after the modal verb or after the subject in questions.  ► adverbs",
    "focus": "MODALITY / can: FORM: WITH ADVERBS",
